  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "intro",
      "performer": "Eminem, Kim",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Aw, look at daddy's baby girl",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "That's daddy's baby, little sleepy head",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Yesterday, I changed your diaper, wiped you and powdered you",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "How did you get so big? Can't believe it, now you're two",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Baby, you're so precious, daddy's so proud of you",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Sit down, bitch, you move again, I'll beat the shit out of you (Okay)",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "Eminem, Kim",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Don't make me wake this baby, she don't need to see what I'm about to do",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Quit crying, bitch, why you always make me shout at you?",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "How could you just leave me and love him out the blue?",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Oh, what's the matter, Kim? Am I too loud for you?",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Too bad, bitch, you're gonna finally hear me out this time",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "At first I'm like, \"Aight, you wanna throw me out? That's fine\"",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "But not for him to take my place, are you out your mind?",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "This couch, this TV, this whole house is mine",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "How could you let him sleep in our bed? Look it, Kim",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Look at your husband now (No) I said look at him",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "He ain't so hot now, is he? Little punk",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Why are you doing this? Shut the fuck up, (You're drunk)",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "You're never gonna get away with this You think I give a fuck?",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Come on, we're going for a ride, bitch (No) Sit up front",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "We can't just leave Hailie alone, what if she wakes up?",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "We'll be right back, well, I will, you'll be in the trunk",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "Eminem",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "So long, bitch, you did me so wrong",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I don't wanna go on",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Living in this world without you",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "So long, bitch, you did me so wrong",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "I don't wanna go on",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Living in this world without you",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "Eminem, Kim",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "You really fucked me, Kim, you really did a number on me",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Never knew me cheatin' on you would come back to haunt me",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "But we was kids then, Kim, I was only eighteen",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "That was years ago, I thought we wiped the slate clean",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "That's fucked up (I love you) I just—oh God, my brain is racin'",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "(I love you) What are you doing? Change the station",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "I hate this song, does this look like a big joke? (No)",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "There's a **** year old little **** layin' dead with a slit throat in your livin' room",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Haha, what, you think I'm kiddin' you?",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "You loved him, didn't you? (No)",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Bullshit, you bitch, don't fuckin' lie to me",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "What the fuck's this guy's problem on the side of me?",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Fuck you, asshole, yeah, bite me",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Kim? Kim, why don't you like me?",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "You think I'm ugly, don't you? (It's not—)",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "No, you think I'm ugly (Baby)",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "Get the fuck away from me, don't touch me",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "I hate you, I hate you, I swear to God, I hate you",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "Oh my God, I love you",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "How the fuck could you do this to me? (I'm sorry)",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "How the fuck could you do this to me?",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
