    {
      "section_id": "section_5",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "Eminem, Kim",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Come on, get out I can't, I'm scared",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I said get out, bitch, let go of my hair",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Please don't do this, baby, please, I love you",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Look, we can just take Hailie and leave, fuck you",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "You did this to us, you did it, it's your fault",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Oh my God, I'm crackin' up, get a grip, Marshall",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Hey, 'member the time we went to Brian's party",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "And you were, like, so drunk that you threw up all over Archie?",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "That was funny, wasn't it? Yes",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "That was funny, wasn't it? Yes",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "See, it all makes sense, doesn't it?",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "You and your husband have a fight, one of you tries to grab a knife",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "And during the struggle he accidentally gets his Adam's apple sliced (No)",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "And while this is going on, his son just woke up",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "And he walks in, she panics, and he gets his throat cut (Oh my God)",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "So now they both dead and you slash your own throat (No)",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "So now it's double homicide and suicide with no note",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "I should've known better when you started to act weird",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "We could've—hey, where you going? Get back here",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "You can't run from me, Kim, it's just us, nobody else",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "You're only making this harder on yourself",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "Haha, gotcha, go ahead, yell",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "Here, I'll scream with you: Ahh, somebody help",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "Don't you get it, bitch? No one can hear you",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "Now shut the fuck up and get what's comin' to you",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "You were supposed to love me",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "Now bleed, bitch, bleed",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "Bleed, bitch, bleed",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "Bleed",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        }
      ]
    },
